# Pixel-format mapping used when a decoded frame is handed to OBS.
# 'closest PIXFMT' prints the pixel format the player converts the decoded frame to (closest_format) and the
# OBS video format that format maps to (convert_pixel_format). Formats the player cannot hand over unchanged
